  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-spatial-join-analysis:\n\n- Provides spatial join analysis between two vector layers with support for various spatial relationships (intersects, within, contains, crosses, touches, overlaps, nearest).\n- Includes attribute aggregation statistics (count, sum, mean, max, min) on join results.\n- Accelerated by STRtree for fast spatial queries.\n- Supports both synthetic (offline) and real-data (local files only) modes, with outputs in GeoJSON/JSON and a manifest file.\n- Runs fully offline with strong privacy: no network requests and all computations are local.",
